    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MCDONALD & ASSOCIATES - EXPERIENCED, PROFESSIONAL, TRUSTED - have been favoured with the insturction to sell this superbaly located Substantial, Residential Holding, Graigue House, extending to approx. 3 acres, on the  outskirts of Mountmellick Town.\r\n\r\nPresently unzoned, there is Long Term Development Potential for the land.\r\n\r\nIt is located in close proximity to the current proposed zoning areas in the Mountmellick Local Area Plan 2024 - 2030. \r\n\r\nThere may be potential for 'one-off sites' subject to PP from the Rosenallis road.\r\n\r\nGraigue House & Lands are set on a prominent site in close proximity to all local amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from excellent accessibility from the N80, Tullamore/Portlaoise Road & Rosenallis Road.\r\n\r\nThe lands contain a 3 Bay Detached House with Annex & Associated Outbuildings. \r\n\r\nMay be suitable for variety of uses to include a Small Holding, Equestrian Centre or Commercial uses subject to PP.\r\n\r\nVacant/Derelict Grants available for the Main House subject to approval.\r\n\r\nServiced by Mains Water."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Superb Location adjacent to Mountmellick Town Boundary.\r\n• Excellent Development Potential with Derelict Main House, Annex and a number of Outbuildings. \r\n• Lands accessible from N80 Tullamore/Portlaoise Road & Rosenallis Road.\r\n• Long term development potential due to its location to the town boundary.\r\n• May be suitable for a variety of uses to include a small holding/equestrian centre or commercial enterprises subject to PP.\r\n• Has potential for 'one-off' sites subject to PP.\r\n• Mains water.\r\n• Private Gated Drive to Main House from the Rosenallis Road.\r\n• Freehold Title – Folio LS30194F.\r\n• Vacant/Derelict Grants available for the house subject to approval."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: Exempt"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
